{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Volley|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Ashe
|skill        = W
|icon         = Volley.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ashe''' shoots a volley of arrows in a cone in the target direction, each dealing {{as|physical damage}} to the first enemy hit, and applying ''{{ai|Frost Shot 2|Ashe|Critical Slow}}'' to enemy {{tip|champions}} hit.
|leveling     = {{st|Arrows|{{ap|7 to 11}}}}
{{st|Physical Damage|{{ap|60 to 200}} {{as|(+ 100% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
|description2 = Enemies can intercept multiple arrows but do not take damage from any beyond the first.
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|1200|Not including the offset, see notes}}
|angle        = {{dv|{{tt|{{ap|27.75|37|37|46.25|46.25|key={{degrees}}}}|Full cone}}|{{tt|{{fd|4.625}}{{degrees}}|Angle between individual missiles}}}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|20|Each missile}}
|speed        = 2000
|cooldown     = {{ap|18 to 4}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cost         = {{ap|75 to 55}}
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Physical
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = aoe
|projectile   = True
|notes        =
* The missiles are spawned in a straight horizontal line 75 units in front of '''Ashe''', with a total width of 75/100/100/123/123 units.
** Between each missile spawn location is a distance of {{fd|12.5}} units, except for the two outermost ones at the last two ranks (which are {{fd|11.5}} units from the closest other one), and the two centermost missiles at ranks 2 and 4 (which have 20 units between them and 15 units to the next missile, respectively).
** This inconsistent behaviour of spawn locations means the angle between each missile can vary off of {{fd|4.625}}{{degrees}} slighty.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
<!--Blurb-->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Ashe}} fires arrows in a cone dealing {{as|physical damage}} and applying {{ai|Frost Shot|Ashe|Critical Slow}} to the first enemies hit.
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Enchanted Crystal Arrow|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Ashe
|skill        = R
|icon         = Enchanted Crystal Arrow.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ashe''' fires a massive arrow of ice in the target direction, briefly granting {{tip|sight}} of the {{tt|area|Cannot grant sight through terrain and can only grant sight into brush when the missile flies through that brush}} it flies through. The arrow shatters upon hitting an enemy {{tip|champion}}, dealing them {{as|magic damage}}, {{tip|stun|stunning}} them for {{pp|type=distance traveled|1 to 1 for 5;1 to 3.5 for 10|0 to 2800|formula=1s for the first 800 units traveled; 1+(0.25 per 200 units)s beyond 800 units. ''This is capped at 2800 units traveled.''}} seconds, and granting {{tip|sight}} of the area around them for 1 second. 
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|200 to 600}} {{as|(+ 120% AP)}}}}
|description2 = Enemies surrounding the primary target are dealt the same damage and afflicted with ''{{ai|Frost Shot|Ashe}}''.
|range        = Global
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|400|Radius of explosion}}|{{tip|sight|icononly=true}} {{tt|350|Missile sight radius}}}}
|speed        = {{pp|1500 to 2100 by 200|type=Seconds traveled|changedisplay=true|formula=1500 base speed + 200 acceleration}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|260|Missile width}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|100 to 60}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cost         = 100
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = aoe
|projectile   = True
|notes        = 
* ''Enchanted Crystal Arrow's'' projectile has an [[File:Enchanted Crystal Arrow Minimap.png|40px|link=]] icon on the mini-map while it is in flight. It can be seen by only '''Ashe''' and her allies.
{{Effect at cast time start}}
* The effect will be centered on the first champion struck, not at the location the missile collided with them.
<!--Blurb-->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Ashe}} launches a crystal arrow of ice that {{tip|stun|stuns}} the first enemy champion hit, dealing {{as|magic damage}}. The arrow accelerates initially and its stun duration increases the farther the arrow has traveled.
|blurb2       = Surrounding enemies take {{as|magic damage}} and are {{ai|Frost Shot|Ashe|slowed}}.
}}

